      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear the pain in your words, and I want you to know that ending your life would not \"help the system\" or stop the \"error\" of feeling alone; instead, it would end the very feeling of hope and life you are struggling to protect. The \"glitch\" you feel is a real and uncomfortable symptom of depression, not a reason to stop trying to find help that can actually fix the pain. Please consider reaching out to a crisis counselor or a doctor who can help you get the support you need to feel safe and less like a \"delete\" code.",
